1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:16,180
So, I am here to tell you all that I am very proud to announce that Smart, Funny & Black will be doing two free shows in Nashville, Tennessee on June 17th in partnership with the National Museum of African American Music.

2
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,900
When I say free shows, I am gifting these shows to the city of Nashville.

3
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:25,480
I'm footing the bill and we're going to have all of the trappings.

4
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:27,140
My band will be there.

5
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:28,860
The slideshow will be there.

6
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:29,840
I will be there.

7
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:39,100
And we are going to be doing two free shows at the National Museum of African American Music on June 17th in partnership with their Juneteenth activities.

8
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:48,740
I'm doing this because when I looked at what's going on in Tennessee and we saw what happened with the Tennessee 3, I just felt like, you know what, these people, they need a break.

9
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:56,300
And I just keep feeling like I'm seeing all of these right-wing places and these people gathering and they be supporting each other in their foolishness.

10
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:59,580
We need to be supporting each other in our dopeness, in our greatness.

11
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:07,100
In our innovation, we need to be supporting each other in our healing, in our revitalization, fighting all the time wears you out.

12
00:01:07,100 --> 00:01:09,100
Where can we go to get built back up?

13
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:11,100
You can go to Smart, Funny & Black.

14
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:14,520
I ask that everyone only get two tickets.

15
00:01:14,860 --> 00:01:22,980
Sign up at AmandaSeals.com and get your tickets to Smart, Funny & Black June 17th at the National Museum of African American Music in Nashville, Tennessee.

16
00:01:23,340 --> 00:01:23,980
See y'all there.

17
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:25,900
Smart, Funny & Black!

